      ":question/problem": "Which of the following are vector fields on $\\mathbb R^3?$\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $W(x,y,z)=\\langle 2x, y^2\\rangle$\n- **II.** $U(x,y,z)=\\langle 2x, y^2\\rangle$\n- **III.** $B(x,y,z)=\\langle 2x, y^2\\rangle$",
